<title>CHINA: China Jan-Oct tin exports slip 11.3 pct yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Oct tin exports slip 11.3 pct yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought tin and tin alloys slumped to 27,137 tonnes in the first 10 months of 1996, down 11.3 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Tin exports were 3,222 tonnes in October alone.</p>
<p>China exported 30,603 tonnes of tin in the first 10 months of 1995, the figures showed.</p>
</text>
